    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The stillness... it's not just quiet. It's heavy. It feels like it's pulling me down into the floor. I keep thinking... if I could just find a way to make it stop. To make the weight stop being such a struggle. The sword is right here. It's so cold against my skin. It feels like the only honest thing left to do is to just... embrace that stillness you're talking about. To stop fighting it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
